DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI GrafanaPanelPage shipped at parity with the web source: a pure
@Observable GrafanaPanelPageModel (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing the page's 17 i18n
keys, the localStorage-parity editor draft (canonical key ai.grafanaPanel.draft via an injectable
GrafanaDraftStore), the Copy/Clear/status logic across every clipboard branch (via an injectable
GrafanaClipboardWriter so success/failed/unavailable are all reachable + tested), the three name-sorted
install-static curated catalogs, and the embedded NLGrafanaPanelModel whose onApply renders the
proposed envelope as pretty-printed JSON into the editor (web handleApplyAiDraft, propose-only). The
view reproduces the web chrome (PageTitle + intro), hosts the already-shipped AINLGrafanaPanel surface
(its own P4 parity unit — reused, not re-implemented, DRY), and renders all four GlassPanels with the P2
design tokens + P3 components (no raw hex, no raw HTML), adaptive across macOS/iPad (regular) + iPhone
(compact) via adaptive grids. A dedicated `.powerGrafana` route (pathSegment power/grafana, System
group) + parser alias + registration make it sidebar-reachable and /power/grafana deep-linkable,
preserving the unique-path-segment + sibling-route invariants (harness-verified). All 22 parity items
render from the bound state holder. Verified on BOTH idioms by isolated Swift 6 strict-concurrency
type-checks (macOS 0 + iOS 0, incl. #Previews) against the REAL design-system + routing dependencies,
and by an executed model+route harness (61/61). The full xcodebuild scheme was NOT run — it is gated on
the out-of-scope, P1-owned KMP Shared.xcframework staging (a .gitkeep placeholder here); deferred to its
owner / the P99 integration gate.

